<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>There is no single stucco repair price in Calgary, and a page that gives you one is guessing. What exists is a set of published price lists from individual Calgary firms, and they differ by job, by firm and sometimes between two pages of the same firm's site. Every figure below is in Canadian dollars and named to the firm that publishes it, with that firm's GST wording. None is averaged with another firm's.</p><p>Sandstone Stucco Co is an advertising service paid by independent stucco contractors. It puts homeowners in Calgary, Airdrie, Chestermere, Cochrane and Okotoks in touch with them, and the contractor who quotes your job contracts directly with you. A published firm price is what that firm advertises, not a market rate, and only a contractor who has seen your wall can quote it. Call (403) 555-0148 for a no-obligation quote, or start with <a href="/stucco-repair-calgary/">how a stucco repair is scoped</a>.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 56px;"><div style="max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;">
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 22px;">2026 Price Ranges</h2>
    <div style="overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:10px;">
      <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;min-width:560px;">
        <thead><tr>
          <th style="background:#2A2521;color:#fff;padding:13px 16px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;">Service</th>
          <th style="background:#2A2521;color:#fff;padding:13px 16px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;">Typical Range</th>
          <th style="background:#2A2521;color:#fff;padding:13px 16px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;">Notes</th>
        </tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2B3A44;font-weight:500;">Small patch (chips, small cracks, colour match)</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2A2521;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">Calgary Parging: $550 to $1,125 ex GST. Calgary Stucco and Slate: about $300 to $1,500 (GST not stated)</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#555;">Martini Stone Masonry lists $250 only as a patch added to a larger job, not a stand-alone call-out.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2B3A44;font-weight:500;">Hairline crack</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2A2521;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">Martini Stone Masonry: $500 to $1,500 (GST not stated). Dynamic Painting: $800 to $1,500 (GST not stated, April 2026)</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#555;">Calgary Parging states a minimum service call of $550 to $690 ex GST.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2B3A44;font-weight:500;">Woodpecker (flicker) hole</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2A2521;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">Calgary Parging: $600 first storey, $800 second storey and up (2024 list, GST not stated). Martini Stone Masonry: $250 to $350 per hole on EIFS (GST not stated)</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#555;">Martini says the per-hole price depends on height and access.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2B3A44;font-weight:500;">Around windows and doors, or a bulge</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2A2521;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">Calgary Parging: $975 to $3,000 around windows and doors; $1,450 to $3,000 for a bulge (both ex GST)</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#555;">Martini lists $300 to $800 per opening for window and door resealing (GST not stated).</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2B3A44;font-weight:500;">Wall section or one wall</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2A2521;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">Calgary Parging: $3,700 for an 8 by 5 ft section, $9,650 for a 9 by 30 ft wall (ex GST). Martini: $14,350 for one elevation stripped and refinished in acrylic (ex GST)</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#555;">Martini also lists complete wall restoration at $8,000 to $15,000 (GST not stated).</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2B3A44;font-weight:500;">Parging, per job and per perimeter</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2A2521;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">Calgary Parging (ex GST): recoat one side $975 to $1,700; recoat full perimeter $2,350 to $4,000; parging with acrylic stucco finish $3,100 to $4,850</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#555;">Acrylic finish over parging adds $575 to $1,035 ex GST on Calgary Parging's list. This site does not advertise foundation crack repair, waterproofing or structural work.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2B3A44;font-weight:500;">Full recoat or whole-house re-stucco</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2A2521;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">Martini: $14.50 to $18 per sq ft plus $4.50 for cement board where needed (ex GST). Total Exteriors: $25 to $50 per sq ft for full replacement (GST not stated, Aug 2025)</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#555;">Calgary Stucco and Slate gives a very rough guide of $5,000 to $20,000 and up for full re-coats or re-stuccos (GST not stated).</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2B3A44;font-weight:500;">Stucco removal and stucco painting</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#2A2521;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">No reliable Calgary price published</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3D8C6;color:#555;">The contractor quotes these after seeing the wall. Nothing on this page is a substitute for that quote.</td>
        </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:#888;margin-top:12px;">These are published figures from the firms named above, not our quotes. Your price comes from a written quote for your house.</p>
